WEBVTT

00:08:29.417 --> 00:08:33.257
for your students to be able 
to take classes across institutions?

00:08:33.547 --> 00:08:39.170
What can be done in really augmenting 
your education and experience

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:40.173
to the students,

00:08:40.173 --> 00:08:43.045
so they are really 
not only getting the information,

00:08:43.045 --> 00:08:47.749
but they are building their soft skills
and focusing on their soft skills?

00:08:47.969 --> 00:08:52.079
I think that the big question 
that we still need to all work on

00:08:52.079 --> 00:08:55.709
when we speak about 
reinventing higher education

00:08:55.709 --> 00:08:56.957
or rethinking about it,

00:08:56.957 --> 00:09:01.027
is not to settle 
by saying, "Online education."